# Next.js shadcn/ui Guidelines

## 1. Installation and Setup (P0)

1. CRITICAL: Initial setup with Next.js:
   ```bash
   # Initialize shadcn/ui (interactive mode)
   pnpx shadcn-ui@latest init
   
   # Non-interactive mode with default settings
   pnpx shadcn-ui@latest init -d --yes
   
   # Non-interactive mode with custom settings
   pnpx shadcn-ui@latest init --yes --typescript --style=default --base-color=slate --css-file=app/globals.css --rsc --src-dir
   ```

2. REQUIRED: Configuration options explained:
   ```
   --typescript    # Use TypeScript for component types
   --style         # Style to use (default, new-york)
   --base-color    # Base color for theming (slate, zinc, neutral, etc.)
   --css-file      # Location of global CSS file
   --css-variables # Whether to use CSS variables for theming
   --tailwind-config # Path to tailwind.config.js file
   --components    # Path to components directory
   --utils         # Path to utils directory
   --rsc           # Support React Server Components
   --aliases       # Use import aliases (@/components)
   --src-dir       # Whether to use src directory
   -d, --defaults  # Use default configuration
   -y, --yes       # Skip confirmation prompt
   ```

3. ESSENTIAL: Adding components:
   ```bash
   # Add a single component (interactive)
   pnpx shadcn-ui@latest add button
   
   # Add multiple components (non-interactive)
   pnpx shadcn-ui@latest add --yes button card dialog form input
   
   # Add all available components (non-interactive)
   pnpx shadcn-ui@latest add --yes --all
   ```

## 2. Project Structure (P0)

1. CRITICAL: Recommended component organization:
   ```
   components/
   ├── ui/                # shadcn/ui base components
   │   ├── button.tsx     # Generated by shadcn/ui CLI
   │   ├── card.tsx       # Generated by shadcn/ui CLI
   │   └── dialog.tsx     # Generated by shadcn/ui CLI
   ├── custom/            # Custom components based on shadcn/ui
   │   ├── primary-button.tsx  # Extends ui/button.tsx
   │   └── user-card.tsx       # Composition of ui/card.tsx
   └── providers/         # Context providers for shadcn/ui (theme, etc.)
       └── theme-provider.tsx
   ```

2. REQUIRED: Component extension pattern:
   ```typescript
   // components/custom/primary-button.tsx
   import { Button, ButtonProps } from "@/components/ui/button";
   import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
   
   export interface PrimaryButtonProps extends ButtonProps {}
   
   export function PrimaryButton({ 
     className, 
     children, 
     ...props 
   }: PrimaryButtonProps) {
     return (
       <Button 
         className={cn("bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-bold", className)} 
         {...props}
       >
         {children}
       </Button>
     );
   }
   ```

3. ESSENTIAL: Component composition:
   ```typescript
   // components/custom/user-card.tsx
   import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from "@/components/ui/card";
   import { Avatar, AvatarFallback, AvatarImage } from "@/components/ui/avatar";
   
   interface UserCardProps {
     name: string;
     email: string;
     avatarUrl?: string;
   }
   
   export function UserCard({ name, email, avatarUrl }: UserCardProps) {
     return (
       <Card>
         <CardHeader className="flex flex-row items-center gap-4">
           <Avatar>
             {avatarUrl ? <AvatarImage src={avatarUrl} alt={name} /> : null}
             <AvatarFallback>{name.slice(0, 2).toUpperCase()}</AvatarFallback>
           </Avatar>
           <div>
             <CardTitle>{name}</CardTitle>
             <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">{email}</p>
           </div>
         </CardHeader>
         <CardContent>
           <p>Additional user information goes here.</p>
         </CardContent>
       </Card>
     );
   }
   ```

